# CLAUDE-UI-BASELINE-2026-09-22: this record IS its artifacts.
#
# Git classified the generated PDF as text and warned it would rewrite LF to
# CRLF on checkout, which would corrupt it - a baseline that cannot be opened
# proves nothing. `-text` pins every byte, the same reasoning `.gitattributes`
# at the repository root already applies to the NREOCRC corpus and the
# vendored PDF.js files.
#
# Scoped HERE rather than added to the root file deliberately: the root
# .gitattributes has uncommitted work against it in the shared tree, and a
# per-directory attributes file needs no coordination to land.
*.pdf -text
*.jpg -text
